From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Sheludko <ishell@chromium.org>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:56:18 +0100
Subject: [M156] [objects] Disallow JSObject modifications during GC and GC
 callbacks

Original change's description:
> [objects] Disallow JSObject modifications during GC and GC callbacks
>
> Prevent re-entrant modifications to Map transitions, descriptors, and
> JSObject shapes from GC callbacks, weak handle callbacks, and Oilpan
> sweeping/finalizers, which can corrupt in-progress map and descriptor
> updates when triggered mid-operation.
>
> Bug: 577366752
>
